WEBVTT

00:01.000 --> 00:03.420
<b>7 years ago</b>

00:11.460 --> 00:13.170
Lieutenant General Pereiro.

00:15.000 --> 00:17.250
P-Princess Starlia?

00:17.750 --> 00:19.040
Are you alone?

00:19.040 --> 00:20.040
Yes.

00:20.210 --> 00:22.750
Now, of all times?

00:22.750 --> 00:25.250
Is no one accompanying you?

00:25.250 --> 00:26.960
Why are you at military headquarters?

00:30.170 --> 00:32.000
Princess Starlia?

00:32.420 --> 00:34.040
How can I help you?

00:34.040 --> 00:35.380
I'm purging you.

00:40.750 --> 00:41.880
Princess...

00:41.880 --> 00:43.080
Why?

00:43.500 --> 00:45.540
A murder in broad daylight.

00:45.540 --> 00:48.000
People thought the
Silverware Princess went mad,

00:48.000 --> 00:49.880
but after further investigation,

00:49.880 --> 00:52.920
it was revealed that
Lieutenant General Pereiro

00:52.920 --> 00:56.880
had been plotting a coup d'état with the
help of the neighboring country, Garness.

00:57.210 --> 01:01.330
They asked the princess,
"How did you know?" She told them...

01:02.380 --> 01:06.500
I know who needs be killed
with just one look.

01:07.040 --> 01:08.330
Dragon eyes?

01:11.670 --> 01:15.080
They're well-acquainted with magic,
so it's best to show them.

01:15.630 --> 01:17.540
People born with great magical power

01:17.540 --> 01:19.960
are sometimes born with
non-human physical features.

01:19.960 --> 01:23.330
Furthermore, one of them is
a Thaumaturge himself.

01:23.670 --> 01:30.750
Actually, with someone like him with them,
my eyes should be rather convincing.

01:31.540 --> 01:35.290
But as can be seen from
the foiled coup d'état,

01:35.290 --> 01:39.250
when her instincts tell her someone is guilty,
she kills them without hesitation.

01:39.250 --> 01:41.210
That's how the Silverware Princess operates.

01:41.540 --> 01:47.210
In that case, I'll expose my dragon eyes
and face her head-on!

01:48.290 --> 01:52.710
<b>Episode 9: Negotiation and True Nature</b>

01:51.000 --> 01:54.290
I am Crish Weiss, a Thaumaturge.

01:54.750 --> 01:58.630
But for the most part,
I hide that I'm a Thaumaturge.

01:58.630 --> 02:00.920
I work as an apothecary in the capital.

02:00.920 --> 02:02.250
The capital?

02:02.250 --> 02:03.880
What is happening there now?

02:03.880 --> 02:05.580
Attaboy. Take the bait, four-eyes.

02:05.580 --> 02:07.500
The capital was peaceful.

02:08.630 --> 02:11.790
It was hard to believe the country was being
assailed by unprecedented dragon attacks.

02:11.790 --> 02:13.250
Control your aura.

02:13.250 --> 02:16.130
Be nervous, but not too agitated.

02:16.130 --> 02:21.040
Be afraid while also showing that you hope
if you speak sincerely, they'll understand.

02:21.040 --> 02:24.540
But also convey you feel guilty
about something you can't share.

02:24.540 --> 02:27.290
The city accommodated refugees
under the king's orders.

02:27.290 --> 02:29.290
There wasn't any rampant disorder.

02:29.790 --> 02:31.460
Until today.

02:31.460 --> 02:33.250
There were explosions in the capital.

02:34.210 --> 02:35.790
Explosions?

02:35.790 --> 02:37.960
Was it a dragon attack?
What's the damage like?

02:38.420 --> 02:39.960
I don't know.

02:39.960 --> 02:42.420
A lot of explosions went off out of nowhere.

02:42.670 --> 02:45.380
My servant, who was injured
in the explosion, and I

02:45.380 --> 02:47.880
tried to escape the capital
using Teleportation Magic.

02:47.880 --> 02:49.500
Here's the crucial bit.

02:49.500 --> 02:53.580
I can't let them get even a whiff of the fact
I was behind the bombing.

02:54.170 --> 02:58.290
Before I knew it, I had somehow
ended up in your magic circle!

02:58.290 --> 03:01.500
So the capital has fallen under
the dragons' control.

03:01.500 --> 03:03.170
Can I ask a question?

03:03.170 --> 03:05.250
Where'd ya study magic?

03:05.250 --> 03:08.380
It's not something you can
just teach yourself.

03:08.380 --> 03:12.040
You gotta formally study
to become a Thaumaturge.

03:12.630 --> 03:17.130
Especially powerful,
military-grade magic like teleportation.

03:18.920 --> 03:22.790
Are you a Solarian defector?

03:23.330 --> 03:26.000
Show your discomposure with your aura.

03:26.000 --> 03:27.920
No, certainly not.

03:28.460 --> 03:31.130
I'm not anyone that impressive...

03:31.130 --> 03:32.630
So I hit the nail on the head.

03:33.000 --> 03:36.000
Those guys are ruthless to defectors.

03:36.000 --> 03:39.420
I can't come up with another reason
you'd be furtively living in this country

03:39.420 --> 03:41.580
out of Solarian reach.

03:41.580 --> 03:45.330
That's the backstory
I improvised for Crish Weiss.

03:45.880 --> 03:48.330
The Solarian religion is incredibly powerful.

03:48.330 --> 03:50.630
Their magical techniques tower above
that of other humans.

03:50.630 --> 03:54.880
They're the sole human faction
capable of waging war against our kind.

03:55.170 --> 04:01.830
In my opinion, the ideal course of events
is to assist in their plans as an advisor.

04:01.830 --> 04:06.290
Logically speaking, it's a good idea
to have a Solarian on their side.

04:06.290 --> 04:08.750
You're an excellent liar.

04:09.500 --> 04:14.250
Everything you just said was
a lie mixed with some truth.

04:15.080 --> 04:17.210
Tsk! So I didn't fool her.

04:17.210 --> 04:23.750
Lies don't fool me because my eyes can
perceive the aura emitted by people.

04:23.750 --> 04:26.580
I determine the veracity of one's statements

04:26.580 --> 04:29.170
based on fluctuations in aura
caused by emotions.

04:29.670 --> 04:31.170
But that's not actually how it works.

04:32.130 --> 04:36.830
With practice, it's possible to control
the fluctuations of one's aura.

04:37.380 --> 04:43.130
Thus, I do not look at the fluctuations,
but the color of one's aura.

04:43.130 --> 04:46.420
When someone's speaking truthfully,
their aura is blue.

04:46.420 --> 04:48.790
When someone's speaking dishonestly,
their aura is red.

04:49.380 --> 04:52.170
This is a sensory ability unique to myself.

04:52.170 --> 04:55.960
I'm not saying it's impossible to deceive me,
but it's very difficult.

04:57.250 --> 04:59.250
The color of your aura is...

05:02.460 --> 05:03.960
Not red.

05:03.960 --> 05:05.250
It's actually blue.

05:07.540 --> 05:08.670
However!

05:13.080 --> 05:15.710
Something smells fishy about that blue!

05:16.330 --> 05:18.170
That's smell, not sight!

05:18.460 --> 05:19.880
Please wait!

05:19.880 --> 05:21.630
It's true I partially lied,

05:21.630 --> 05:24.170
but it's true that I'm a Thaumaturge
who fled the capital.

05:28.250 --> 05:29.210
Take it.

05:30.210 --> 05:31.170
Why?

05:31.170 --> 05:33.210
Because you're a top-notch liar.

05:33.210 --> 05:37.170
I give weapons I made myself
to those I favor.

05:37.170 --> 05:38.630
I'm giving you one too.

05:39.750 --> 05:41.880
What's wrong? Take it already.

05:45.580 --> 05:47.130
Should've guessed.

05:47.130 --> 05:48.540
Give it back.

05:49.880 --> 05:54.000
As you can see, I was born with no arms.

05:54.000 --> 05:57.500
Instead of the arms I lack,
I use silver implements.

05:57.500 --> 05:59.630
The same is true for parts of my body.

05:59.960 --> 06:04.080
Thus, it is through silver
that my eyes see past emotions

06:04.080 --> 06:06.380
and perceive the true nature of things.

06:07.290 --> 06:09.920
Take Major Isaac Stern, for example.

06:10.540 --> 06:14.210
He's a stuffy, four-eyed stick in the mud,

06:14.210 --> 06:17.330
but his true nature is also his glasses.

06:17.330 --> 06:19.460
Er, what do you mean by that?

06:19.460 --> 06:21.750
There isn't a difference between
his appearance and his true nature.

06:21.750 --> 06:25.540
Just as he appears, he's a stuffy,
four-eyed stick in the mud.

06:25.540 --> 06:26.670
Hey!

06:26.670 --> 06:30.290
Except for his glasses, the rest of
his body looks dim to me.

06:30.290 --> 06:31.710
Take this seriously!

06:31.710 --> 06:33.920
Do you really need to tease me now?

06:34.630 --> 06:37.960
Ike, has your hair been thinning recently?

06:37.960 --> 06:38.830
Huh?

06:39.170 --> 06:41.790
And that old man waiting in the back...

06:42.290 --> 06:45.830
That's my swordmaster, Garm the Bladewolf.

06:42.290 --> 06:45.830
<b>Chief Swordsman of the Argentum Corps</b>

06:42.290 --> 06:45.830
<b>Garm Ulban</b>

06:45.830 --> 06:51.710
To me, he looks like a man whose body
and sword are blending together.

06:52.130 --> 06:53.670
Person and sword are one!

06:53.670 --> 06:57.670
Tireless training his whole life
resulted in this beautiful form.

06:57.960 --> 07:02.170
If I marry one day, it shall only be to
someone more beautiful than Garm,

07:02.170 --> 07:05.460
but I've yet to encounter such a man.

07:06.000 --> 07:07.380
Princess!

07:07.380 --> 07:11.750
In short, a person's true nature is
the summation of their life story

07:11.750 --> 07:13.830
and the way they've lived.

07:13.830 --> 07:15.580
That cannot be falsified.

07:18.040 --> 07:21.540
Taking all that into account,
your true nature is...

07:23.420 --> 07:26.250
A pitch-black mass of death.

07:27.000 --> 07:29.000
All troops, draw your swords!

07:31.080 --> 07:33.830
How many people have you killed?

07:33.830 --> 07:36.960
Tens of thousands?
Hundreds of thousands? Even more?

07:36.960 --> 07:40.170
Are you the one behind
the explosions in the capital?

07:40.170 --> 07:42.080
W-wait, please!

07:42.080 --> 07:44.960
This is a misunderstanding!
I'm not a dragon or some-

07:44.960 --> 07:47.670
The issue here isn't a matter of
being a dragon or a person!

07:47.670 --> 07:52.380
Compared to your grotesqueness,
even Dornea seemed far better!

07:53.130 --> 07:55.380
Prepare yourself, filth!

07:57.330 --> 07:59.630
You! Please help me!

07:59.630 --> 08:01.710
Aren't we the same?

08:01.710 --> 08:06.000
Please convince her that I can help you!

08:06.000 --> 08:08.750
You of all people should
understand my utility!

08:08.750 --> 08:09.960
No can do.

08:10.920 --> 08:13.170
Excluding logical decisions,

08:13.170 --> 08:16.500
we obey when our commander makes
a decision based on intuition.

08:16.500 --> 08:18.880
That's how our corps operates.

08:18.880 --> 08:19.830
No!

08:22.630 --> 08:25.670
It's fortuitous I met you today.

08:26.170 --> 08:28.170
Now die!

08:30.670 --> 08:33.170
No, don't!

08:33.380 --> 08:34.830
Just kidding.

08:34.830 --> 08:36.290
Go ahead and kill me.

08:36.290 --> 08:38.630
After all, I won't die.

08:38.920 --> 08:40.460
Good grief...

08:40.460 --> 08:42.920
If she stopped trying to see
my true nature,

08:42.920 --> 08:45.380
we could be mutually
beneficial to each other.

08:45.380 --> 08:47.460
She's always like this.

08:47.830 --> 08:50.330
Well, I gotta bite the bullet.

08:50.330 --> 08:53.330
After she kills me, I'll hide in the base.

08:53.330 --> 08:56.380
I'll wait for my chance to
snatch up Ragna and escape.

08:56.380 --> 08:59.670
If a battle takes place here,
that'll be my chance.

08:59.670 --> 09:02.750
While I was lost in thought,
it appears my time to die crept up on me.

09:02.750 --> 09:04.630
Adieu, Argentum Corps.

09:05.210 --> 09:08.790
Olto Zora and Taratectra,
the warmongers of the Blood of the Wings

09:08.790 --> 09:11.080
are coming to slaughter you.

09:11.580 --> 09:13.880
You better fight with everything you've got.

09:13.880 --> 09:15.290
That's not my problem now.

09:16.420 --> 09:17.670
I can't allow that.

09:19.750 --> 09:22.250
Hunting him is my duty.

09:25.920 --> 09:28.380
I don't know exactly what's going on here...

09:28.380 --> 09:31.540
Did you do something
terrible again, Crimson?

09:31.540 --> 09:33.210
I'm the victim here!

09:33.500 --> 09:35.170
The other intruder?

09:35.420 --> 09:37.420
Where in the world did he come from?

09:39.540 --> 09:40.830
Master Garm!

09:40.830 --> 09:41.920
Gyah!

09:42.290 --> 09:43.420
Gyah?

09:45.380 --> 09:47.080
Your Highness!

09:47.080 --> 09:48.000
Wh-wh-wha...?

09:48.000 --> 09:49.540
What on earth happened?
Wh-wh-wha...?<b></b>

09:49.540 --> 09:51.540
Your Highness, that's quite improper.
Wh-wha...?<b></b>

09:51.540 --> 09:52.500
Wh-wha...?

09:52.500 --> 09:55.960
Sword... with... arms... Sword!

09:55.960 --> 09:58.330
Your Highness, keep your composure.

09:58.750 --> 10:00.500
What did you do to her, Crimson?

10:00.500 --> 10:02.000
I didn't do shit!

10:02.000 --> 10:03.460
This is obviously your fault.

10:03.790 --> 10:05.830
But I didn't do anything either.

10:07.630 --> 10:09.170
The Silverware Princess sees the world

10:09.170 --> 10:11.960
with senses that are very different
from an ordinary person's.

10:11.960 --> 10:13.540
So when she saw Ragna,

10:13.540 --> 10:17.130
a man who has surpassed the limits of strength
and has fused with his silver sword,

10:17.130 --> 10:18.710
how does she see him?

10:24.330 --> 10:29.000
Th-that sword has arms and legs!

10:29.960 --> 10:32.460
What is that?

10:32.790 --> 10:33.630
What is that?

10:33.630 --> 10:35.000
Your Highness!
What is that?<b></b>

10:35.000 --> 10:35.750
You bastard!

10:35.750 --> 10:36.750
What did you do to the commander?

10:36.750 --> 10:37.630
The audacity of this man!

10:37.630 --> 10:40.540
No, I didn't really do...

10:40.540 --> 10:41.670
Shut up!

10:41.670 --> 10:43.000
Prepare yourself!

10:48.830 --> 10:50.130
...anything at all.

10:50.130 --> 10:51.580
What's happening?

10:51.580 --> 10:53.330
I can't believe it.

10:53.330 --> 10:56.540
The perfect fusion of a human and silverine.

10:56.790 --> 10:59.080
This is pinnacle of power...

10:59.080 --> 11:01.790
No, it surpasses even that!

11:01.790 --> 11:07.750
I didn't know such a thing
could exist in this world.

11:06.210 --> 11:09.500
<b>Tutor of the Second Royal Princess</b>

11:06.210 --> 11:09.500
<b>Nazarena Teluzian</b>

11:08.500 --> 11:09.500
Princess.

11:09.710 --> 11:11.880
You are no longer grounded.

11:11.880 --> 11:13.750
Get ready to return to the castle.

11:14.080 --> 11:16.670
Oh, that's today?

11:17.080 --> 11:20.210
I was so engrossed in
making my sword I forgot.

11:22.420 --> 11:23.460
Ta-da!

11:23.460 --> 11:25.250
This is a nice piece of work, huh?

11:25.250 --> 11:27.960
Especially for my first time
creating a silver sword!

11:27.960 --> 11:31.880
It looks like I have aptitude for
being a silversmith too!

11:31.880 --> 11:33.210
That figures though!

11:33.210 --> 11:36.170
My overwhelming genius
knows no bounds!

11:36.170 --> 11:38.290
More important than that, Princess...

11:38.290 --> 11:39.920
What's "more important?"

11:39.920 --> 11:45.540
Because of this stunt, your engagement
has been completely called off.

11:45.540 --> 11:47.250
I'm not bothered.

11:47.710 --> 11:51.210
I had no intention of being
married off in the first place.

11:51.210 --> 11:52.710
It bothers me.

11:52.710 --> 11:56.290
I was hired as your personal tutor.

11:56.290 --> 11:59.790
But in actuality, I have more in common
with a feral animal trainer.

11:59.790 --> 12:02.710
When you wed, my contract stipulates that

12:02.710 --> 12:06.500
I'll be paid a sumptuous bonus,
plus hazard pay.

12:06.500 --> 12:08.670
I'm begging you,

12:08.670 --> 12:12.750
please get married by the time you're an adult
so I can enjoy a cushy retirement.

12:12.750 --> 12:16.710
Is it normal for a princess' tutor
to say such things?

12:16.710 --> 12:19.420
They wouldn't say such things
to a normal princess.

12:19.420 --> 12:22.630
If you're so desperate to marry me off,
you must present to me

12:22.630 --> 12:26.630
the sort of amazing man who'd
make me fall head over heels.

12:31.130 --> 12:32.750
Oh lord...

12:33.580 --> 12:36.210
His arms and legs are sculpted to perfection...

12:36.210 --> 12:41.250
His countless scars speak to all
the rigorous battles he has triumphed in.

12:41.250 --> 12:44.670
And he's bursting with the power of silverine!

12:44.670 --> 12:49.000
He's the most powerful yet
composed person I've ever seen!

12:49.000 --> 12:50.500
And above all...

12:51.080 --> 12:54.380
His face is so dreamy!

12:54.380 --> 12:56.000
Sorry for being such a hunk.

12:57.080 --> 12:59.290
Nazarena, what should I do?

12:59.290 --> 13:01.040
That man is...

13:02.250 --> 13:04.460
So unbelievably hot!

13:09.080 --> 13:11.250
Whoa, hold on! This is unseemly!

13:11.250 --> 13:13.080
Your Highness, this is not the time to jest!

13:13.380 --> 13:15.170
Is this man also an enemy?

13:15.170 --> 13:17.040
Did he attack you in some way?

13:18.250 --> 13:19.500
Crimson?

13:19.500 --> 13:21.130
Now, this is a surprise!

13:21.130 --> 13:22.960
I didn't expect this reaction!

13:24.670 --> 13:25.830
Excuse me...

13:27.380 --> 13:29.460
I was rudely staring at him!

13:29.460 --> 13:31.580
He might think I'm a weird girl now!

13:31.960 --> 13:33.880
What should I do, Nazarena?

13:33.880 --> 13:36.830
What in the world am I to do?

13:36.830 --> 13:39.330
Indeed, what are we to do with you?

13:39.750 --> 13:41.460
May I have your attention for a moment?

13:42.290 --> 13:46.420
We don't intend on fighting you.

13:47.080 --> 13:50.080
I-if you don't kill him...

13:50.080 --> 13:52.790
We'll obey your orders.

13:53.130 --> 13:55.830
We'll obey your orders.

14:00.210 --> 14:01.290
All right!

14:03.500 --> 14:07.000
You'll wait here until we decide
how to deal with you.

14:09.080 --> 14:11.330
Crimson, we need to talk.

14:11.330 --> 14:12.750
Agreed.

14:12.750 --> 14:15.250
Well, since they so generously
gave us this room,

14:15.250 --> 14:17.000
let's make ourselves at home and chat.

14:20.130 --> 14:23.170
Crimson, why did you try to run away?

14:23.170 --> 14:25.420
Why did you interfere with my plan?

14:25.750 --> 14:27.920
Because I didn't want to turn tail and run!

14:27.920 --> 14:32.290
The longer Ultimatia is allowed to live,
the more people will die.

14:32.290 --> 14:35.000
We can't waste a second not hunting her.

14:35.000 --> 14:36.540
But you lost.

14:36.540 --> 14:39.790
So I scooped you up and got you out of there.

14:39.790 --> 14:41.630
But you resisted me.

14:41.630 --> 14:43.830
You destroyed one of my vital creations,
the Globe Chamber,

14:43.830 --> 14:45.630
and Chimera's whereabouts are unknown.

14:45.630 --> 14:47.920
I also don't know what happened to Golem.

14:48.170 --> 14:49.040
Tsk!

14:49.380 --> 14:52.380
How do you plan on compensating
for those losses?

14:52.380 --> 14:54.580
By hunting Ultimatia!

14:57.000 --> 14:59.380
Crimson, that hurts.

14:59.380 --> 15:02.960
I'm adjusting your out-of-whack aura.

15:02.960 --> 15:06.630
It seems like you really overdid it
in that battle earlier.

15:07.000 --> 15:09.380
Oh, okay. Thanks.

15:09.380 --> 15:12.380
When I've recovered,
let's go back to the capital right away.

15:12.380 --> 15:16.290
Why don't you comprehend
a single thing I say?

15:16.290 --> 15:17.830
That really hurts.

15:17.830 --> 15:19.960
But my feelings won't change

15:21.130 --> 15:22.750
By the way, Crimson...

15:22.750 --> 15:25.290
I was thinking about what you said, and...

15:25.290 --> 15:27.290
Is Mister Slime dead?

15:29.500 --> 15:31.540
It'sh me, your number one shervant!

15:31.540 --> 15:33.250
Oh, I forgot about him.

15:35.460 --> 15:37.750
There's a bit of him sticking to you.

15:43.630 --> 15:44.580
<b>3 minutes later</b>

15:44.880 --> 15:45.710
Puru?

15:45.710 --> 15:46.960
He shrank.

15:46.960 --> 15:48.670
Mashter Crimshon!

15:48.670 --> 15:50.830
Yet another loss of valuable assets.

15:50.830 --> 15:52.330
This is on you.

15:52.710 --> 15:53.750
Sorry.

15:53.750 --> 15:56.330
Apologize with more shinsherity!

15:56.330 --> 15:57.790
I'm super sorry.

15:58.500 --> 15:59.750
Inshidentally,

15:59.750 --> 16:01.710
where ish thish?

16:01.710 --> 16:03.630
I'd also like to know that.

16:03.630 --> 16:06.460
We're at a military training ground
in northern Lese.

16:06.880 --> 16:11.000
It's an ancient, underground facility
that was excavated and restored.

16:11.710 --> 16:14.630
I'll take this opportunity
to explain in detail

16:14.630 --> 16:17.880
the dangerous situation
the people at this base are in.

16:18.210 --> 16:19.250
Puru.

16:19.670 --> 16:21.460
After you hear this,

16:21.460 --> 16:24.830
I wonder if you'll still want to
immediately return to the capital.

16:26.790 --> 16:29.080
How long do we need to stay here?

16:29.080 --> 16:30.750
It's already been five days!

16:30.750 --> 16:32.250
What's happening outside?

16:32.250 --> 16:33.830
Let us see the Silverware Princess!

16:33.830 --> 16:34.670
Stop!

16:34.670 --> 16:37.330
No civilians are allowed entry
beyond this point!

16:37.670 --> 16:39.420
This is getting bad.

16:39.420 --> 16:41.540
Not knowing why, they were taken here

16:41.540 --> 16:43.880
and are being held in uncomfortable
conditions underground.

16:43.880 --> 16:45.580
This might turn into a riot.

16:45.580 --> 16:48.210
That's what happens when you pack
1,500 people in like sardines.

16:48.210 --> 16:49.790
If we hadn't taken them here,

16:49.790 --> 16:53.210
they would've listened to the
radio broadcast and went to the capital.

16:53.210 --> 16:56.330
We knew it was a trap.
We couldn't just abandon them!

16:56.330 --> 17:01.420
Well, you use saving civilian lives
as a way to motivate soldiers.

17:01.750 --> 17:03.580
Are we done here?

17:03.580 --> 17:08.040
I'm busy 'cuz you lot get the benefits,
while the Thaumaturges do all the dirty work.

17:09.000 --> 17:12.250
I'd like the intruders' presence
to be kept confidential.

17:13.880 --> 17:18.830
Her Highness swiftly decided the self-proclaimed
Thaumaturge should be put to death.

17:18.830 --> 17:22.830
The other man is so abnormally powerful
he handily beat Master Garm.

17:22.830 --> 17:24.920
These two are clearly too much
for us to keep in check.

17:26.250 --> 17:29.380
I don't want the troops to get
agitated by this situation.

17:29.380 --> 17:30.830
How much?

17:30.830 --> 17:32.330
You're demanding a bribe?

17:34.750 --> 17:37.420
Did the old man really lose?

17:34.750 --> 17:38.500
<b>Chief Swordsman</b>

17:34.750 --> 17:38.500
<b>Christopher Algren</b>

17:34.750 --> 17:38.500
<b>Chief Swordsman</b>

17:34.750 --> 17:38.500
<b>Shin Cutlass</b>

17:39.130 --> 17:40.750
Who told you that?

17:41.500 --> 17:42.750
The old man himself.

17:42.750 --> 17:43.790
Master Garm!

17:44.960 --> 17:48.540
We got back from scouting and
found him sobbing in the corridor.

17:48.540 --> 17:50.540
He's been crying this whole time?

17:50.830 --> 17:52.420
Princess!

17:53.040 --> 17:54.880
Well, Master Garm...

17:54.880 --> 17:57.130
is the strongest swordsman in this country
and the surrounding countries.

17:57.130 --> 17:59.830
He once cut a superior dragon's limb off,

17:59.830 --> 18:02.710
and he even dealt the final blow to Dornea.

18:03.080 --> 18:07.540
But he was easily defeated by
a snot-nosed punk not even half his age.

18:07.540 --> 18:11.040
I cannot imagine the mental blow
that must have been for him.

18:11.170 --> 18:12.500
Princess!

18:12.500 --> 18:16.380
Your pawpaw...
Pawpaw is beside himself!

18:16.710 --> 18:21.000
Pawpaw, I've met a man
who's stronger than you at last.

18:21.000 --> 18:22.830
Thanks for everything!

18:22.830 --> 18:25.210
I'm getting married!

18:25.210 --> 18:26.250
Married!

18:26.420 --> 18:27.670
Married!

18:27.670 --> 18:29.250
Princess!

18:29.250 --> 18:31.420
This guy killed the old man?

18:31.420 --> 18:34.250
Nice! Lemme at him!

18:34.250 --> 18:35.830
He's not dead!

18:35.830 --> 18:37.790
Give me your report first.

18:37.790 --> 18:40.710
I'm not answering any questions
until after that.

18:40.710 --> 18:42.540
What's happening with the dragons?

18:42.540 --> 18:44.420
Can it, four-eyes.

18:44.420 --> 18:46.670
We aren't your subordinates.

18:46.670 --> 18:49.210
Answer our questions first, baldy!

18:49.210 --> 18:51.210
You pea-brained dragon hunters!

18:51.210 --> 18:52.250
And I'm not bald!

18:52.250 --> 18:57.210
<b>Chief Gunner</b>

18:52.250 --> 18:57.210
<b>Hesela</b>

18:52.250 --> 18:57.210
<b>Chief Gunner</b>

18:52.250 --> 18:57.210
<b>Greya</b>

18:52.960 --> 18:55.130
Has Miss Lia really fallen in love?

18:55.130 --> 18:57.210
Is it true she fell in love with
the intruder at first sight?

18:57.380 --> 18:58.500
Is it true?

18:58.500 --> 18:59.500
Yeah, it is!

18:59.500 --> 19:01.750
Everyone's gossiping about it!

19:01.750 --> 19:03.960
By any chance, is it the same guy
who killed the old man?

19:03.960 --> 19:06.330
Lemme at him!

19:06.330 --> 19:06.920
What's he like?

19:06.920 --> 19:07.710
Are you even listening to me?
What's he like?<b></b>

19:07.710 --> 19:08.170
Are you even listening to me?
Is he an ape?<b></b>

19:08.170 --> 19:09.130
Shin, you've got no chance.
Is he an ape?<b></b>

19:09.130 --> 19:10.380
Shin, you've got no chance.
Don't all talk at once!<b></b>

19:10.380 --> 19:12.290
I'm headin' back to work.

19:12.290 --> 19:13.750
Speaking of which, where is Miss Lia?

19:13.750 --> 19:14.750
H-Her Highness is...

19:17.210 --> 19:19.130
Hwaah...

19:22.380 --> 19:24.500
Sorry for being such a hunk.

19:25.130 --> 19:27.880
Princess, please pay attention.

19:27.880 --> 19:28.960
Huh?

19:34.920 --> 19:37.500
What is the meaning of this?

19:37.500 --> 19:40.420
It's been a while since I've landed
such a nice blow on you.

19:40.420 --> 19:43.330
Typically, you dodge such attempts.

19:44.000 --> 19:45.750
Do you know the reason
you didn't just now?

19:45.750 --> 19:46.880
I don't know!

19:47.130 --> 19:48.380
Why?

19:48.380 --> 19:51.580
It's because you've
fallen in love with that man.

19:54.210 --> 19:55.540
What are you talking about?

19:55.790 --> 19:59.670
Have your brains turned into
muscle, you lady ape?

20:04.380 --> 20:06.000
Acknowledge it.

20:06.000 --> 20:11.380
Otherwise, I'll continue to pummel your body.

20:12.130 --> 20:14.960
I-is this what love is?

20:15.330 --> 20:18.040
Sure, I think he's a hottie...

20:18.460 --> 20:20.540
He has a chiseled figure,

20:20.540 --> 20:24.500
and his looks are a bit old-fashioned
like the Sylvestrian style.

20:24.500 --> 20:28.380
His balance of aesthetics and utility
is of the ultimate caliber.

20:28.380 --> 20:32.830
The smooth curves of his center
are sorrowful, even sexy.

20:34.580 --> 20:39.580
I didn't know I was so shallow about looks!

20:41.580 --> 20:45.420
Our mentalities about this
are so different I can't relate to her.

20:45.790 --> 20:47.920
Isn't this a positive thing?

20:47.920 --> 20:51.130
As your tutor, it makes me happy
you've fallen for someone,

20:51.130 --> 20:53.750
even if it's due to his looks.

20:54.830 --> 20:56.710
Gorillena...

20:57.210 --> 20:59.830
The Argentum Corps is a mighty force.

21:01.580 --> 21:05.580
If you were to list the strongest
fighters in this country,

21:05.580 --> 21:09.420
most of them would be
members of this corps.

21:09.420 --> 21:10.880
Of course.

21:10.880 --> 21:14.880
I put my trust in them because they're
on par with the strength of my weapons.

21:15.130 --> 21:19.880
But without you, they're just
a mob of talented riffraff.

21:21.000 --> 21:27.500
Your strength, your ability as a silversmith,
your charisma as a leader,

21:27.500 --> 21:32.250
and your royal rank bring many
varied people under your command.

21:32.250 --> 21:37.630
Soldiers, mercenaries, dragon hunters,
Thaumaturges, assassins.

21:37.630 --> 21:43.580
There are many people who support you,
but none of them can replace you.

21:44.380 --> 21:47.210
Being in love is wonderful and all.

21:47.210 --> 21:50.210
But you must fulfill your duty.

21:50.210 --> 21:54.080
You are the hope of every single person here.

21:55.830 --> 22:00.580
You would have me mercilessly bear this duty.

22:00.580 --> 22:03.040
And what would happen if I were
crushed by the weight of it?

22:03.420 --> 22:06.130
There are people who, the greater
the duty on their shoulders,

22:06.130 --> 22:08.500
the greater their shine.

22:09.380 --> 22:10.710
In that case,

22:11.330 --> 22:14.830
I, Starlia, the Silverware Princess,
must be such a person!

22:21.130 --> 22:22.880
Lady Ultimatia...

22:26.960 --> 22:28.210
God.

22:28.210 --> 22:29.750
I am so sorry.

22:30.580 --> 22:33.880
Despite the gift of your blood and name,

22:33.880 --> 22:35.750
I was defeated by the enemy.

22:36.710 --> 22:38.460
But please do not fret!

22:38.460 --> 22:41.750
I assure you; I'll actualize
the world you desire-

22:46.040 --> 22:47.330
God?

22:48.170 --> 22:49.920
Why?

22:49.920 --> 22:52.250
Tell me, why?

22:53.130 --> 22:55.830
Why didn't you...

22:56.670 --> 22:59.880
Save me, sister?

23:02.130 --> 23:04.790
It hurts! It's so hot!

23:05.500 --> 23:09.250
Sister!

23:24.330 --> 23:26.080
Heed me, creation,

23:26.080 --> 23:27.290
and fall still.

23:36.210 --> 23:37.710
Why?

23:38.460 --> 23:40.540
Why is this happening?
